        <div class="small-12 medium-6 cell callout">
            <h3>What is telementoring for substance use disorder?</h3>
            <p>Telementoring involves leveraging web technologies to coach and train others in best practices, with the
                intent of building individual and workforce capacity. Telementoring eradicates the limitations of
                physical and geographic proximity between mentors and mentees.  At C-STAT, we utilize the Extension for
                Community Healthcare Outcomes (ECHO) model as our primary mode of telementoring.</p>
        </div>
